<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Zenith sees coal mine acquisition deal soon.</title>
<headline>Zenith sees coal mine acquisition deal soon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zenith Concessions Ltd, referring to a cautionary first issued on May 22, said on Tuesday due diligence in connection with the acqusition of a coal mine in the Middleburg region could be completed within the next 14 days.</p>
<p>The firm said negotiations for other mining projects continued at a preliminary stage and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
